{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":50879,"duration_api_ms":50446,"num_turns":17,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md` and didn't commit it. I checked the build and CI files, but I haven't run any builds, `ecc` or `ecli`.\n\n**Fixed from the old version:**\n- It said all dependencies are in `src/third_party`. In fact `blazesym` and `bpftool` are submodules, so builds fail unless you clone with `--recursive`.\n- It said every example builds with `make`. Examples 1–10, 20 and 25 (plus the `31-goroutine` BPF code) have no Makefile and use `ecc` / `ecli` instead.\n- Its topic grouping (the `src/19-21,…` category list) was partly wrong, so I dropped it.\n\n**Added:**\n- How CI smoke-tests an example: a 3-second `sudo timeout -s 2 3 <binary>` run, where exit code 124 counts as success.\n- The Makefile pipeline: `libbpf.a` and `bpftool`, then `vmlinux.h`, then the `.skel.h` skeleton, then the loader link.\n- Each example's Makefile is a near-copy of the others, so a build fix has to be repeated in each one.\n- The docs conventions: parallel English and Chinese READMEs, `src/scripts/guideline_*.md`, and `SUMMARY.md`.\n\nI left out the examples' usage steps, since the READMEs cover them.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"03c515d7-406c-4aa7-8ba5-1c1db08813ca","total_cost_usd":0.25510455,"usage":{"input_tokens":22,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16397,"cache_read_input_tokens":333316,"output_tokens":6237,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16397},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":40320,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1875,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1875,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":22,"outputTokens":6237,"cacheRea